OL,3,GNEWSAEx-council chief convicted of two
OL,4,Acharges over deleting email
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former chief executive of Mid and
OL,7,FEast Antrim Council has been convicted
OL,8,Fof two charges connected to deleting or
OL,9,Fattempting to delete an email to
OL,10,Fprevent disclosure under the Freedom of
OL,11,FInformation Act.
OL,13,FAnne Donaghy, 56, of Clonmore Road,
OL,14,FDungannon, has been fined #1,500. She
OL,15,Fwas cleared of a third charge of trying
OL,16,Fto have an email deleted.
OL,18,FHer co-accused Aaron McClelland, of
OL,19,FClonmakate Road in Portadown, was also
OL,20,Fcleared of one charge of trying to have
OL,21,Fan email deleted. It was the only
OL,22,Fcharge he faced.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
