OL,3,GNEWSAEx-council chief convicted of two
OL,4,Acharges over deleting email
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Mid and East Antrim
OL,7,FBorough Council said it will "carefully
OL,8,Fconsider the outcome and any
OL,9,Fimplications arising" from the verdict.
